flowchart TD
  A[Entry] --> B[Orient]
  B --> C{Required input complete?}
  C -- No --> D[Show inline guidance]
  D --> C
  C -- Yes --> E[Review summary]
  E --> F{Confirm action?}
  F -- No --> G[Return to edit]
  G --> E
  F -- Yes --> H[Show completion state]
  H --> I[Offer next relevant action]
  Q[Quality gates: labels; focus; keyboard order; readable errors; recovery; non-color status; reduced motion] -.-> B
  Q -.-> H